            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ok, I see that this is simply a matter of using `mks! ~/.dotfiles/dotvim/sessions/` (that is just where I personally keep my sessions) to save and `so ~/.dotfiles/dotvim/sessions/<Session name>` to recall. Simple enough to define some mapping for this but it would be nice to have an `MSSave`, `MSLoad` etc. command. My instinct was to search with telescope on all commands for \"session\" and it would be nice to have found all that directly.",
