            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Well, error message says it all. You have unsaved buffer number 44. By default, `MiniSessions.read()` doesn't work if there is at least one unsaved buffer. That is something 'vim-startify' does, if I remember correctly. To ignore that, set `force` option to `true`: either in `config.force.read` inside `setup()` or as extra argument to `select()`.",
